{"text": "The only ones. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who were pleased were the Snow and the Frost. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Spring has forgotten this garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So we will live here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All year. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Snow covered the grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the Frost painted the trees silver. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then they invited. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The North Wind and the Hail. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To stay with them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I cannot understand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why the Spring is so late in coming. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the Spring never came. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the Summer did not come either. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Autumn gave golden fruit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To every garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But she gave none to his. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He is too selfish. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giant was lying in bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he heard lovely music. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was only a little linnet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Singing outside his window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked out of the window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And saw a wonderful sight.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "o", "n", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "o", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "p", "l", "e", "a", "s", "e", "d", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "S", "n", "o", "w", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "F", "r", "o", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "p", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", "g", "o", "t", "t